---
description: Writing or fixing .NET tests
globs: tests/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- One behavior per test. Name tests as snake_case sentences describing
  the behavior (match existing tests).
- Use the spec's worked examples as test data; cite the rule number.
- These projects use VSTest (xunit 2 + Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk), not
  Microsoft.Testing.Platform. Filter with FullyQualifiedName~.
